    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Analyze the stated free-energy objective and numerically search its state space for minima in which locations are duplicated, identities are incorrect, or the target form is not reached. Any such minimum or nonconvergent trajectory under the stated assumptions refutes the guarantee.";
